% SIG-1221 synthetic fixture. Every position and comment below was written for
% this repository; none of it comes from a book or a course. Positions are
% small constructed settings so each theme is verifiably present (or, for the
% deliberate miss, verifiably absent from the extractor's facts).

[Event "Forks"]
[Chapter "Forks"]
[FEN "r3k3/8/8/1N6/8/8/8/4K3 w - - 0 1"]
[SetUp "1"]
[RatingBand "<1200"]
[Phase "endgame"]

1. Nc7+ { A fork on c7: the knight checks the king and attacks the rook at the same time. } 1... Kd7 2. Nxa8 *

